{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"verdan_old_burner","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_old_burner.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"An old man sat on a crate near the market's edge, staring at nothing.","text_ko":"시장 가장자리, 한 노인이 궤짝에 앉아 허공을 응시하고 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_expansion/ch02_nameless_burner_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"His face was placid. Smooth. Not peaceful, empty. Like a mask worn by someone who had forgotten what expressions were for.","text_ko":"얼굴은 평온했다. 매끈했다. 평화로운 게 아니라, 비어 있었다. 표정이 무엇에 쓰이는 물건인지 잊은 사람이 쓴 가면처럼."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Old Man","text":"Excuse me. Could you... tell me what my name is?","text_ko":"실례합니다. 혹시... 제 이름이 뭔지 아십니까?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"I don't know your name.","text_ko":"당신 이름은 몰라."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Old Man","text":"That's alright. Neither do I. I've been asking people all morning. No one knows.","text_ko":"괜찮습니다. 저도 모르거든요. 아침 내내 물어보고 다녔는데. 아무도 모르더군요."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"He smiled. The smile didn't reach his eyes. It couldn't. There was nothing behind them for it to reach.","text_ko":"그가 웃었다. 웃음은 눈까지 닿지 않았다. 닿을 수 없었다. 그 뒤에는 닿을 것이 남아 있지 않았으므로."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"Old Man","text":"I think I used to be important. I have this feeling, right here...","text_ko":"예전엔 제가 중요한 사람이었던 것 같습니다. 이런 느낌이 있어요, 바로 여기에..."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"He pressed a hand to his chest.","text_ko":"그는 가슴에 손을 댔다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/8","jump":null,"original_index":8,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":8,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":8,"text":{"speaker":"Old Man","text":"...like something should be there. Something heavy. But when I look, it's just ribs and air.","text_ko":"...무언가 있어야 할 것 같은. 무거운 무언가가. 그런데 들여다보면, 갈비뼈와 공기뿐입니다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/9","jump":null,"original_index":9,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":9,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"We should go.","text_ko":"가자."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_old_burner/10","jump":null,"original_index":10,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":7,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":10,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":10,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Arrel looked at the old man. The old man looked back. Two mirrors facing each other, one just further along the same road.","text_ko":"아렐이 노인을 바라보았다. 노인이 마주 보았다. 마주 놓인 두 개의 거울, 하나가 같은 길을 조금 더 멀리 갔을 뿐인."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"4f29a3d8d412a7205584fffb83552553e79564c19ae8bb8ff2140d4a8293c81e","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
